Dear Parishioners,

We are pleased to share that the replacement of the concrete surfaces in front of the church and along both sides of the building has been completed. As a result, water will no longer accumulate in these areas, making the church grounds safer and more convenient for everyone.

<!--more-->

We are also happy to announce that a new metal fence has been manufactured and will be installed in the near future.

These improvements represent a significant financial investment. We sincerely thank everyone who has contributed through donations toward the beautification and maintenance of our church. Your support helps preserve and improve our shared house of worship. We are also grateful to those who continue to support our parish with their donations and prayers.

May God bless you for your generosity and care for our church!

With gratitude and appreciation,
Pastor and Parish Council